// Mock backend for developing the interface in a plain browser (`npm run dev`).
// The scan is generated by the real Rust evaluator from a recorded snapshot:
//   cargo run -p framewise-checks --example scan -- --from crates/framewise-checks/fixtures/gaming-desktop.json --json > src/mock-scan.json
// Fixes, Undo and Cleanup are simulated: nothing on the PC changes.
